31	// recordForeignEvidence resolves evidence paths to their repos and records
32	// every foreign repo in the machine-level session record — enabled or not:
33	// the Enabled flag preserves evidence for lazy-enable integration, and slice 2
34	// filters on it. Evidence comes from two sources:
35	//
